
"Dr Mundo": You've learned how matter can exist in different states.

Player: Solid, liquid, and gas.

"Dr Mundo": Exactly.

"Dr Mundo": But knowing the state of matter is only part of understanding it.

"Dr Mundo": We can also ask what matter is made of.

Player: What matter is made of?

"Dr Mundo": Yes.

"Dr Mundo": Some substances contain only one type of element.

"Dr Mundo": Others contain different elements that are chemically combined.

"Dr Mundo": Andrew can demonstrate this using the Fusion system.

"Dr Mundo": Go and speak with him.

